vg\" width=\"11.02ex\" height=\"1.597ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 4871 706\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D440\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D440\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1328.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2384.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D706\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D706\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3189.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(4190,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D43F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43F\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>The moment of inertia of a ring about a diameter is given by the formula:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.781ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"8.747ex\" height=\"3.006ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -983.7 3866.1 1328.7\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(781.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(1837.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D440\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D440\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(1051,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D445\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D445\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(792,363) scale(0.7